d</mtext><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\"><mspace width=\"0.222em\"></mspace></mstyle><mn>7</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mtd><mtd></mtd><mtd><mi></mi><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mstyle mathcolor=\"red\"><mo>×</mo></mstyle></mrow></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>3</mn><mo>⋅</mo><mn>5</mn></mtd><mtd><mi></mi><mo>≡</mo><mn>15</mn><mo>≡</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>⋅</mo><mn>7</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>≡</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>≢</mo><mn>4</mn></mtd><mtd></mtd><mtd><mi></mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mtext>mod</mtext><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\"><mspace width=\"0.222em\"></mspace></mstyle><mn>7</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mtd><mtd></mtd><mtd><mi></mi><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mstyle mathcolor=\"red\"><mo>×</mo></mstyle></mrow></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>3</mn><mo>⋅</mo><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mstyle mathcolor=\"blue\"><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mn>6</mn></mrow></mstyle></mrow></mtd><mtd><mi></mi><mo>≡</mo><mn>18</mn><mo>≡</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>⋅</mo><mn>7</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>≡</mo><mn>4</mn></mtd><mtd></mtd><mtd><mi></mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mtext>mod</mtext><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\"><mspace width=\"0.222em\"></mspace></mstyle><mn>7</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mtd><mtd></mtd><mtd><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mstyle mathcolor=\"green\"><mi>✓</mi></mstyle></mrow></mtd></mtr></mtable></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container></p>\n<p>Therefore, the solution is <mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"25\" style=\"font-size: 119.4%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D465 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"4\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2261\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-texatom space=\"4\" texclass=\"ORD\"><mjx-mstyle style=\"color: blue;\"><mjx-texatom texclass=\"ORD\"><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c36\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn></mjx-texatom></mjx-mstyle></mjx-texatom><mjx-mstyle><mjx-